sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent /<br/>bootstrap
  participant S as Forwarder
  participant C as EgressAuthorizer<br/>OCC
  participant P as Provider
  Note over S,P: Proposed continuation after resolve:<br/>captured operation remains immutable
  S->>C: check(before_send)
  Note over S,P: Caller, versioned route, grant and actual operation<br/>Selected material identity/version or explicit absence<br/>Static evidence binds mode, target store / scope and exact version
  C-->>S: Allow, deny or unavailable
  Note over S,P: Policy receives no credential bytes<br/>Do not substitute another operation or material
  alt Allow, usable material if needed, within deadlines
    S->>S: Recheck usability,<br/>send-start and original<br/>operation deadlines
    S->>P: Strip Agent auth,<br/>inject if needed, send once
    P-->>S: Response, error or stream
    S->>S: Apply provider response policy<br/>Headers, body, trailers, encodings
    S-->>A: SafeResponse or response_blocked
  else Denied, unavailable, unusable or too late
    S-->>A: Refuse before send
  end
  Note over A,P: Each subrequest, redirect, retry or new operation repeats the checks<br/>Resolve again when needed, no provider material or handles enter the Agent
  Note over S,P: provider_rejected retains SafeResponse + typed feedback<br/>CredentialResolver.reportRejection deduplicates authenticated receipt / version
  Note over S,P: Rejection or unsafe response after dispatch<br/>does not prove no effect, no automatic retry
